    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10609" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-spūto</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. freq. a.
			conspuo, <i>to spit upon in contempt</i>
			(very rare): nostros coeperunt Clodiana, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Q. Fr.
				2, 3, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maledictus et consputatus, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Jud. 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Idol. 1</span></i>.</div>
